{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19108260","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19108260","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1910826001:1":{"text":"这玩意……咱做的，也、也不是，是咱和<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>一起做的。","source_cn":"这玩意……咱做的，也、也不是，是咱和<style=st...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x98F7DA32082F3A46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910826002:1":{"text":"总之，给你，戴不戴随你。","source_cn":"总之，给你，戴不戴随你。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x29AABA8260564F4B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910826003:1":{"text":"……好美的月亮！你们什么时候做了这么漂亮的饰品出来？","source_cn":"……好美的月亮！你们什么时候做了这么漂亮的饰品出来？","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xA58708F11F878D75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910826004:1":{"text":"咱……呃，总之……咱想说……之前很多事，对不起。","source_cn":"咱……呃，总之……咱想说……之前很多事，对不起。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x9A03E3DBD898A45E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910826005:1":{"text":"——就、就这样了！别想听咱说第二次！","source_cn":"——就、就这样了！别想听咱说第二次！","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xD4B474C45F566FD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910826006:1":{"text":"我很喜欢。真的，很喜欢！谢谢你们！","source_cn":"我很喜欢。真的，很喜欢！谢谢你们！","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x1C1F6E35C41097C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910826007:1":{"text":"这是你们送我的幸运符，是家人亲手制作的宝贵礼物！","source_cn":"这是你们送我的幸运符，是家人亲手制作的宝贵礼物！","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x7979CB72A3995399","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1910826008:1":{"text":"我会一直戴着它，永远永远都不摘下来！","source_cn":"我会一直戴着它，永远永远都不摘下来！","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x256F1D18CC097FB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1910826009:1":{"text":"그래, 가족이 선물해 준 소중한 보물이니까 영원히, 영원히 간직해야지.","source_cn":"是啊，家人赠送的珍贵宝物，要永永远远保存下来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBDFB20E46862B8B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1910826010:1":{"text":"하지만 필멸자는 언젠가 사라지는 법이란다. “영원”이라는 말은 그저 거짓말이지. 이 얼마나 슬픈 일이니.","source_cn":"可惜，凡人终有一天会消失，“永远”只是个谎言。多么悲伤啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4671A9705144E6EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1910826011:1":{"text":"...톨란?","source_cn":"……图澜？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71DDF7DA4D1CC26E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1910826012:1":{"text":"하지만 걱정 말렴. 이제 슬픈 일은 없을 테니.","source_cn":"但不用担心，不会再有悲伤的事发生了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA55F81DB07E362B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1910826013:1":{"text":"안, 안 돼...","source_cn":"不，不要……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x244C8EBBDB0998E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1910826014:1":{"text":"너와 네 가족들은 다시는 헤어지지 않고 영원히 함께할 거란다.","source_cn":"你和你的家人们会永远在一起，永远也不会分开。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3221516BEAE840E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1910826015:1":{"text":"너희는 육지의 필멸자들과 달라. 진정 네가 속한 곳으로 돌아와 우리와 다시 하나가 되렴, 사랑하는 나의 일부여.","source_cn":"你们与陆地的凡人并不一样。去真正属于你的地方，与我们重...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91B47A33A16F73A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1910826016:1":{"text":"영원히, 영원히.","source_cn":"永远永远。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F